    "description": "Signing of the Sri Lanka - Singapore Free Trade Agreement",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=8571",
    "lang": "en",
